From d6fda345f58e1d1096ecb3534e625f510932bbfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GariTrip Dev <dev@garitrip.local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 08:47:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add With-Driver stage 1: driver model, vehicle detail fields,
 overlap-based assignment

- Add Driver model (fullName, phone, status) and DriverStatus enum
- Add variant/year/registrationPlate to VehiclePackage (nullable, backward compat)
- Wire driverId onto Booking (nullable, assigned post-creation by an admin)
- Shared overlap-based driver-availability logic in utils/driverAvailability.js,
  used by both GET /drivers?available=true and booking driver assignment
- New driverController.js + routes/drivers.js (admin/employee only), reusing
  userController's name/phone validation conventions
- New PUT /bookings/:id/assign-driver endpoint with real overlap checking
  (checks against PENDING/CONFIRMED bookings, excluding the booking itself)
- vehicleController create/update accept the new vehicle detail fields
